      "index": 10,
      "text": "He means this.",
      "path": "audio/1971-176/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.03424
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Ho Koji sings: How wondrous this, how mysterious!",
      "path": "audio/1971-176/12.mp3",
      "start": 2.480045,
      "end": 5.9802040000000005
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "I carry fuel, I draw water.",
      "path": "audio/1971-176/13.mp3",
      "start": 7.251837,
      "end": 9.82898
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "He also means this.",
      "path": "audio/1971-176/14.mp3",
      "start": 11.262540000000001,
      "end": 12.686167999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "And when you are near me whatsoever I may say I always mean this.",
      "path": "audio/1971-176/15.mp3",
      "start": 14.046939,
      "end": 17.758503
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Or I may not say anything - but then too I always mean this.",
      "path": "audio/1971-176/16.mp3",
      "start": 19.160951999999998,
      "end": 23.72
    }
  ]
